{"id":"zrya","lemma":"зря","pos":"adv","rank":903,"glosses":["in vain, to no avail, for nothing","mistakenly, making a mistake (used to indicate someone ought not to do/think/etc. something, or to express the sentiment that it's too bad that they do)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/Ru-%D0%B7%D1%80%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D1%80%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Всё было зря.","en":"It was all in vain.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Всё это может быть зря.","en":"All this could be for nothing.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"maybe"]]},{"text":"Зря ты пришёл.","en":"I wish you hadn't come.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Зря вы пришли.","en":"I wish you hadn't come.","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Зря я это сделал.","en":"I was wrong to do that.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]}]}